<section class="landing-how">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="how-steps">
        <div class="how-step">
            <div class="step-number">1</div>
            <h3>Register your farm and plots</h3>
            <p>Name your farm, add field workers and managers, then map your plots. No GPS required—just plot names and sizes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
            <div class="step-number">2</div>
            <h3>Plan crop cycles</h3>
            <p>Schedule plantings by plot and crop variety. Set expected harvest dates. Track one active crop per plot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
            <div class="step-number">3</div>
            <h3>Log field activity</h3>
            <p>Record watering, inspections, pest sightings, and spray applications. Attach photos. Build your compliance history.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
            <div class="step-number">4</div>
            <h3>Record harvests</h3>
            <p>Log partial harvests as you pick. Track quantities by unit. Compare yields across seasons and plots.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="landing-proof">
    <h2>Built for working farms</h2>
    <div class="proof-grid">
        <div class="proof-stat">
            <strong>Multi-season tracking</strong>
            <p>Compare what worked last spring, adjust for next year</p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-stat">
            <strong>Compliance-ready logs</strong>
            <p>Timestamped records with photos for audits and certifications</p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-stat">
            <strong>Farm team access</strong>
            <p>Owners, managers, and field workers—everyone sees what they need</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
